        <briefdescription>
<para>Creates a new <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_texture2_d" kindref="compound">Texture2D</ref> object based on the current Rendering API. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function creates and returns a reference to a <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_texture2_d" kindref="compound">Texture2D</ref> object, which is specific to the currently used rendering API. It takes as input a pointer to an image data structure (tmx_image). The type of texture created will depend on the current <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_renderer_a_p_i" kindref="compound">RendererAPI</ref> in use. If no supported Rendering API is found, it asserts false and returns nullptr.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername><ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_image" kindref="compound">Image</ref></parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Pointer to the image data that the <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_texture2_d" kindref="compound">Texture2D</ref> object should be based on.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>A reference to a <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_texture2_d" kindref="compound">Texture2D</ref> object of the appropriate type for the current <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_renderer_a_p_i" kindref="compound">RendererAPI</ref> in use. If no supported API is found, it returns nullptr. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
